(1) International Property Maintenance Code (IPMC) 2006 edition, with Georgia amendments;
(2) 1997 Standard for Amusement Devices;
(3) SBCCI Excavation and Grading Code, 1975 edition;
(4) International Existing Building Code (IEBC), with Georgia Amendments;
(5) Uniform Swimming Pool Spa and Hot Tub Code;
(6) Chapter 1. Administration, Sections 101 through 107 of the 2006 International Building Code, specifically excluding Appendix A. Employee Qualifications;
(7) Part "X" of ANSI A17.1-1984, the American National Standard Practice for Inspection of Elevators, Escalators and Moving Walks, Inspector's Manual ANSI A17.2, the Safety Standards for Manlifts ANSI A90.1a-1976, the Safety Standard for Construction Hoists ANSI A10.4-1981 and ANSI A10.5-1981, the Safety Standard for Conveyors and Related Equipment ANSI B20.1-1984, or the latest revised rules and regulations adopted by the Georgia Commissioner of Labor;
